<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen and Co said it raised its 1997 earnings per share estimates on Guidant Corp to $2.60 from $2.50 and boosted 1998 to $3.35 from $3.25.</p>
<p>-- Cowen maintained its strong buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/4 at 57.</p>
</text>
